abstract: >-
  Supplementary datasets, selected analytical scripts, code fragments,
  statistical outputs and documentation associated with a PhD investigation
  of twentieth-century fire-regime variability in Temperate Highland Peat
  Swamps on Sandstone in the upper Blue Mountains, eastern Australia.
